Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] DW3_START_MODE test hook applies on the boot's newGame only

Test hook (PC env, nothing changes when DW3_START_MODE is unset): the forced
start mode of patch 0020 applied on every newGame(), so a restart (P6.9) or
the field menu's Return to title (P6.27, patch 0123) from a run started with
DW3_START_MODE went straight back into the forced field instead of the
title. It now applies on the boot's newGame() only. The replay scenarios
us/eu-return-title need the reset to reach the title (US) or the language
select (EU) from the South Sector field they start in.

--- a/src/engine/game/state.c
+++ b/src/engine/game/state.c
@@ -32,10 +32,14 @@
         const char *start = getenv("DW3_START_MODE");
         char *end = NULL;
         long mode;
+        /* Only the boot's newGame: a restart (P6.9, the field menu's Return
+           to title, P6.27) must reach the title, not the forced mode again. */
+        static int start_mode_used;
 
-        if (start != NULL && start[0] != '\0') {
+        if (start != NULL && start[0] != '\0' && !start_mode_used) {
             mode = strtol(start, &end, 0);
             if (end != start && mode > 0) {
+                start_mode_used = 1;
                 GAME.mode = (s32)mode;
                 GAME.nextMode = (s32)mode;
                 fprintf(stderr, "dw3: DW3_START_MODE=0x%lx\n", mode);
